{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"荃灣大壩街有地下鹹水管爆裂\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/BURST-TW-261123-07.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】荃灣大壩街清晨有地下鹹水管爆裂。</p><p>現場是大壩街23號對開。清晨5時左右，行人路一條地下鹹水管爆裂，磚塊被水沖起，路面滿佈沙石，水務署派員關上水掣搶修。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T00:23:52.890236+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":83,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T23:41:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T23:36:27.785972+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T00:17:46.610561+00:00","content_hash":"13cb3a5fbe80aa9b89152a246bc97d184ec769ae157588e3b2ddf732e093b10b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}